@swf2es/native/compress: the LZMA SDK
=====================================

The LZMA encoder and decoder in this package's WebAssembly binary are
compiled from the LZMA SDK 26.05's C sources (C/LzmaEnc.c, C/LzFind.c,
C/LzmaDec.c and the headers they include), by Igor Pavlov, unchanged but
for line endings in swf2es/lzma-sdk. Each
of those files states:

  Igor Pavlov : Public domain

and the SDK's DOC/lzma-sdk.txt says:

  LZMA SDK is written and placed in the public domain by Igor Pavlov.

  Anyone is free to copy, modify, publish, use, compile, sell, or distribute
  the original LZMA SDK code, either in source code form or as a compiled
  binary, for any purpose, commercial or non-commercial, and by any means.

This notice records where they come from.

https://www.7-zip.org/sdk.html


